The new signal tests reproduced all three cycle-2 issues before the fix. The evaluation tail now finishes under `deferred_termination`, and training and recovery print `CERTIFIED` with the correct directory after a committed signal. The touched suite is running with SIGINT initially ignored to verify the background-shell case too.
